# Context efficiency

- Prefer `docs/ai/*.md` over scanning `client/`, `server/`, or `shared/`.
- Do not read every `.cursor/skills/vvr-project/*.md` file. Open only the topic that matches the task.
- Avoid parallel broad globs (`**/*`) when the map already names paths.
- Reuse findings already in the conversation; do not re-explore the same area.
- Keep edits inside the named task area. Match existing Vue/Pinia/Express style.
- After architecture/location/feature changes, run the `update-project-context` workflow; skip docs for minor edits (`docs/ai/MAINTENANCE.md`).
